        <p><strong>"Your project must use neatlogs, Entire and cfo.ai."</strong> Effective use of the required tools is 25% of the score on its own, and the evidence you submit — traces, checkpoint links, a business plan — is what the judges look at. A great agent with no instrumentation loses to a decent agent with all three hooked up. Install Entire <em>before</em> your next commit: it can only capture sessions going forward, and "public repo with hackathon-dated commits" is also a submission requirement.</p>
