        <p>The single track is deliberately wide: <em>"Build an AI agent, or a team of agents, that completes a substantial task from start to finish."</em> A travel agent that goes from "I have four days in November and ₹60k" to a priced, booked-shaped itinerary fits that framing well — it has real tools, real failure modes, and a cost per run you can model.</p>
